    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.poster.avif?t=1737807967\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.webm?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.mp4?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/394226ff4cd424e14b622b487258040b.avif?t=1737807967\" width=160 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abigail is the youngest member of JunkSec, a salvage company specializing in recovering objects and artifacts from the ruins of the Old City, destroyed 10 years ago when an apparition appeared in the skies above it. <br>Now it is a tangle of old buildings and seemingly new ones, growing and spreading from the old city centre and only halted by great barrier walls surrounding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While investigating a newly discovered underground facility that seems to date from before the disaster the crew are split up and ambushed inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now cut off from her teammates, Abigail has to rush deeper and deeper into the ruins before the facility's aging reactor goes critical and kick-starts the City's spread across the whole continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/df241287c4ace39a155f219ca43bb734.poster.avif?t=1737807967\" width=240 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/df241287c4ace39a155f219ca43bb734.webm?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c43d5af93c24a4d642a2c5e70e6172fa.avif?t=1737807967\" width=160 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 360\u00b0 Aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A UI you can see from Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large underground facility and parts of the surrounding City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight twisted creatures and automated security</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/9d4113827b60d7e785429f0caee5c2ae.avif?t=1737807967\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.poster.avif?t=1737807967\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.webm?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c0dc3250c9327ffa7f7373324be51b19.mp4?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/394226ff4cd424e14b622b487258040b.avif?t=1737807967\" width=160 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abigail is the youngest member of JunkSec, a salvage company specializing in recovering objects and artifacts from the ruins of the Old City, destroyed 10 years ago when an apparition appeared in the skies above it. <br>Now it is a tangle of old buildings and seemingly new ones, growing and spreading from the old city centre and only halted by great barrier walls surrounding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While investigating a newly discovered underground facility that seems to date from before the disaster the crew are split up and ambushed inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now cut off from her teammates, Abigail has to rush deeper and deeper into the ruins before the facility's aging reactor goes critical and kick-starts the City's spread across the whole continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/df241287c4ace39a155f219ca43bb734.poster.avif?t=1737807967\" width=240 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/df241287c4ace39a155f219ca43bb734.webm?t=1737807967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/c43d5af93c24a4d642a2c5e70e6172fa.avif?t=1737807967\" width=160 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 360\u00b0 Aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A UI you can see from Space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large underground facility and parts of the surrounding City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight twisted creatures and automated security</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354930/extras/9d4113827b60d7e785429f0caee5c2ae.avif?t=1737807967\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore, Fight, Scavenge, Escape. Fight your way out of recently unearthed underground facility teeming with disgusting creatures in a pixelart survival-horror, platform shooter mix. Will you save the rest of your squad, or will you recreate the very disaster that left this place buried?",
